      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potosi%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Potosi was formed in 1841 by merging three smaller villages called Head of the Hollow, Van Buren, and Lafayette.",
