      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potosi%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Potosi Brewery operated from 1852 to 1972 before reopening in 2008 as a museum and brew pub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
